        "topic": "P2 grounded versus airborne state correction",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/README.md:19",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/weapon_trait_bespoke_lasgun_p2_followup_shots_ranged_damage.md:14",
