        ],
        "evidence_path": "AI-LOGS/Game Info/local/blessings/2026-10-03/sustained-fire-agent-counter-state-correction.json",
        "evidence_sha256": "50843e3f8c52cf29eafbf4e4b0dbb2d094332092d143c783b614ec1e3b4bb79e",
        "conclusion": "Accepted. The frozen correction supersedes the earlier counter addendum: grounded crouch_moving inherits still and is 0.5s; crouch_still is 0.5s; airborne maps to moving regardless of crouch and uses 1.2s. Final player, variant, and source-index text uses the corrected distinction."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Own tiers, shared counter/cache and conditional-map override",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/README.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/TIER_VALUES.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/SOURCE_INDEX.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. I–IV add ranged_damage .14/.16/.18/.20; the held-slot wrapper reads shared num_shots 1–3, while Shotgun P4 uses combo_count 1–3. General firing increments at prepare and misses consume counts; cache-before-weapon ordering, current spread/state strict clear, switch-to-none T=0 possibility, and the four P2 dont_clear action exemptions are stated with limits. Staff own tier conditional maps replace the entire wrapper map, so the apparent +.05 charge conditional does not coexist."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Shotgun combo, first-shell and last-pellet behavior",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/README.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/weapon_trait_bespoke_shotgun_p4_followup_shots_ranged_damage.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/SOURCE_INDEX.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. Both P4 marks use combo_count and strict >0.2s post-action reset, separate from spread timers. An idle first shell starts at zero, while a first shell chained from a still-live reload/aim/special-load action can start at one; final pellet batches read player stats at processing time. Wording preserves the timing condition and does not equate each pellet with a shot."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Damage consumer and worked example",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/README.md:37-40",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/DAMAGE_PERCENTAGE_REVIEW.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. The consumer requires attack_type=ranged OR profile.count_as_ranged_attack and adds the coefficient to the shared damage bucket. Under the stated D=100, q=.20, p=.20 assumptions the result is 140 versus 120 (+16.67% relative); 144 would incorrectly multiply additive terms."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Special damage routes and weapon coverage",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/README.md:24-29",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/SOURCE_INDEX.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. P1 ActionExplosion and P1/P4 splash profiles do not pass the ranged type/profile gate; P4 direct projectile damage is separately ranged. P3 chain defaults to ranged where applicable, but does not add num_shots or guarantee a surviving valid cached count. Ordinary melee/toggles are excluded; the final text keeps model-specific exceptions."
      },
      {
        "topic": "RAW localization, UI bindings, image and formatting",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/持續射擊/LOCALIZATION_COMPARISON.md",
