          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/ranged/README.md",
          "Referneces/Translation.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. The English and zh-TW name/description keys and resource hash match the frozen RAW receipt; tier strings are formatter-based reconstructions and ordinal wording is explicitly distinguished from implementation counters. All eighteen names derive from metadata family/pattern/mark keys and actual import/ukeys/append wiring. The image receipt verifies icon path separately from attachment URL, with matching SHA-256, 128x128 dimensions, and display verification. FASTER remains unverified and disabled."
